cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ClassicalLieAlgebra in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ClassicalLieAlgebra: generators, bases, Young tableaux, and irreducible representations of the classical Lie algebras"
abstract: >-
  A Wolfram Language paclet for the classical simple Lie algebras (su, so, sp):
  generators in the standard, Cartan-Weyl, and Chevalley bases; root-system data;
  a Young-tableau toolkit for many-body wavefunctions; and a representation engine
  that builds any irreducible representation from its highest weight -- dimension,
  weight system, Casimir eigenvalue, and explicit generator matrices, including the
  orthogonal and symplectic spinor representations -- in exact arithmetic.
type: software
authors:
